{"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTabBar"}],"symbolKind":"struct","title":"OUDSTabBar","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTabBar"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","beta":false}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents10OUDSTabBarV","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Components"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"The Tab bar is a system navigation component with a position which can vary depending to the OS.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The tab bar can be found at the bottom of the screen for iOS. It can vary for iPadOS.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It allows users to switch between the sections of an app.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Each tab can be represented by a label, optionally paired with an icon, and maintains persistent visibility across top-level destinations.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstabbar"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSTabBar","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Content"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Content","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Navigations"]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Appearances","level":2,"anchor":"Appearances"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS 26 brings Liquid Glass, the new Apple look and feel which will prevent developers to define specific styles for some critical components like bars."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Because today the OUDS tab bar relies on native component and is not designed from scratch, some elements will look different between iOS 26 and older versions:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"background color of tab bar can be changed for iOS lower than 26"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"background color of tab bar does not change since iOS 26"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"normal \/ unselected tab item color can be changed for both image and text only for iOS lower than 26","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"with iOS 26 no token of color are applied on unselected \/ normal tab item because only the image will be changed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and not the text making theme not readable in dark color scheme","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In addition the badges colors will be the same and cannot be changed (except with token definition). These particular badges do not rely on "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeStandard","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeCount","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the native API is used instead."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Because Liquid Glass is available since iOS 26, the tab bar will be liquified \/ glassified since this OS version, not before.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"However if an app is built with Xcode 26 and the flag ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" set to ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"YES","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", then Liquid Glass won’t be applied but the alternative layout."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Nevertheless with Xcode 27 and for iOS 27, Liquid Glass will be always applied, whatever the value of the flag is."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you use SF Symbols for images, if they exist their "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"fill"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" variant will be automatically used in the tab bar (native behaviour)."}]},{"text":"Platform considerations","type":"heading","anchor":"Platform-considerations","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This component is tailored for iOS","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"On iPadOS the tabs do not apply the fonts since iPadOS 18","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Because macOS does not support UIKit and because UIKIt is used to define the style of the tab bar, there is no styling of the tab bar for macOS","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"visionOS with its specific UI does not apply colors on tab bars and things are glasssified"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component is not available for watchOS"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The component is not available for tvOS","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Guidelines","type":"heading","text":"Guidelines"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS guidelines recommends to:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"limit when possible the number of items to 5","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"use both images and texts in tab bar items","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"use badges only when needed to avoid to have heavy tab bar"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"be sure the selected information is not only defined by the color of the tab; you may need to change the shape or the fill of the image"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"if a badge must be displayed, prefer short texts. If the text is a decimal value greater than 99, prefer display “+99”"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"if decorative images are used for tab bar item, apply "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"template"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" rendering mode on it to apply color on tabs"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Accessibility considerations"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If your tabs embedded in the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTabBar"},{"text":" do not contain texts but only images, add an accessibility label introducing the journey for this tab","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If your tabs embedded in the "},{"code":"OUDSTabBar","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" display a badge (empty or with text), vocalize it in your tab to let users know what it is (unread messages, new things, etc)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"by using accessibiltiy value","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    OUDSTabBar {","        SomeView()","            .tabItem {","                Label {","                    Text(\"Emails\") \/\/ The text is vocalized first","                        .accessibilityValue(\"5 unread emails\") \/\/ A value vocalized after the text","            } icon: {","                Image(systemName: \"mail\").accessibilityHidden(true)","            }","        }","        .badge(5) \/\/ The value you give to the badge","    }",""]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Selection-of-tabs","level":2,"text":"Selection of tabs"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For iOS lower than 26, a selected tab indicator is displayed in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSTabBar","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" ; the "},{"code":"count","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter must be defined (to the number of tabs in the component),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"and if the ","type":"text"},{"code":"selectedTab","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" binding value is equal to a given tag associated to a tab item.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Otherwise the indicator won’t appear; these parameters are mandatory to compute the location of the indicator.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This rule is only applied if selected tab indicator must be displayed.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"When the user taps a tab, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"selectedTab"},{"text":" binding is updated automatically, keeping the parent view in sync.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Technical considerations","anchor":"Technical-considerations"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In order to improve the Developer eXperience the current "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTabBar"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation lets users define their own tab items."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OUDS applies only appearances and styles on elements to prevent users to define raw data to assign to the component before being rendered like a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"picker"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus users will need to add their own accessiiblity label if badges are used or also apply "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"template"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" rendering mode on images if needed.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus it will be also possible to use Liquid Glass new API with animations and items stacking."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You must use in your tab bar items images with "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"a size of 26 x 26","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", otherwise rendering could be unaligned with Figma specifications"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Because the component cannot compute the ideal width of the selected tab indicator (for iOS before 26 and iPadOS before 18), ideal width based on the tab bar item content,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"this indicator is not displayed for iOS lower than 26 in landscape mode and iPadOS."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If your app uses several universes with nested views, containing their own navigation and tab bars, prefer ","type":"text"},{"code":"hideTabBar()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" to hide the tab bar"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TabView"},{"type":"text","text":" and overlay items) with Liquid Glass is disabled or not available, or also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tabBar(isHidden:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples","level":2},{"code":["    \/\/ Use the OUDS tab bar to wrap tab bar items and associated views","    \/\/ Item tagged 0 will be selected first, 3 tabs are embedded.","    \/\/ Image with size of 26 x 26","    @State private var selectedTab = 0","","    OUDSTabBar(selectedTab: $selectedTab, count: 3) {","","        \/\/ Add the views with the SwiftUI tab item and labels","        \/\/ No need to define colors, everything is done inside OUDSTabBar","        SomeView()","            .tabItem {","                Label(\"Label 1\", image: \"image_1\")","            }","            .tag(0) \/\/ Must match the selectedTab binding value","        OtherView()","            .tabItem {","                Label {","                    Text(\"Label 2\")","                } icon: {","                    Image(decorative: \"image_2\")","                        .renderingMode(.template) \/\/ Mandatory to apply color on selected item","                }","             }","            .tag(1) \/\/ Must be used for the selectedTab binding","        LastView()","            .tabItem {","                Label(\"Label 3\", image: \"image_3\")","            }","            .tag(2) \/\/ Must be used for the selectedTab binding","    }"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Alternative components","type":"heading","anchor":"Alternative-components","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you want to use SwiftUI ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tab"},{"type":"text","text":" View with or without rules, use instead "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabView","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"If you target apps with Liquid Glass enabled and need "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tab"},{"type":"text","text":" or rules, use instead "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLiquidGlassTabView","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Design documentation","level":2,"anchor":"Design-documentation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-ios-tab-bar","type":"reference","isActive":true}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Themes rendering","level":2,"anchor":"Themes-rendering"},{"type":"heading","text":"Liquid Glass","level":3,"anchor":"Liquid-Glass"},{"type":"heading","text":"Orange","level":4,"anchor":"Orange"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_dark"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Orange Compact","level":4,"anchor":"Orange-Compact"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_light"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_dark"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Sosh","level":4,"anchor":"Sosh"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_dark"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Wireframe","level":4,"anchor":"Wireframe"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_dark","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Without Liquid Glass","anchor":"Without-Liquid-Glass"},{"type":"heading","level":4,"text":"Orange","anchor":"Orange"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Orange_light","type":"image"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Orange_dark","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":4,"text":"Orange Compact","anchor":"Orange-Compact"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_dark"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Sosh","level":4,"text":"Sosh","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Sosh_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Sosh_dark","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":4,"text":"Wireframe","type":"heading","anchor":"Wireframe"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Wireframe_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Wireframe_dark"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Version","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"1.0.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"Since","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"1.0.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/init(content:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/init(selectedTab:count:content:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/body"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/View-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"references":{"ic_folder_categories.png":{"type":"image","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","alt":null,"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/ic_folder_categories.png"}]},"component_tabBar_Orange_dark":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_Orange_dark.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image","alt":"A tab bar component in dark mode without Liquid Glass effect and Orange theme","identifier":"component_tabBar_Orange_dark"},"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_light":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_light.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_light","alt":"A  tab bar component in light mode with Liquid Glass effect and Sosh theme"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents":{"type":"topic","title":"Components","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The catalog of all components provided by OUDS. It contains also ","type":"text"},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifiers"},{"text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views.","type":"text"}]},"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_light":{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_light","alt":"A tab bar component in light mode with Liquid Glass effect and Orange theme","type":"image","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_light.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSTabBar/init(selectedTab:count:content:)":{"kind":"symbol","title":"init(selectedTab:count:content:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Defines the tab bar component with given tab bar items and a two-way binding to the selected tab index.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Number of tabs and selected tab are needed to compute the selected tab indicator for iOS lower than 26."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If you target iOS 26+ or other platform, prefer instead "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTabBar(content:)"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstabbar\/init(selectedtab:count:content:)","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"selectedTab","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"Binding","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI7BindingV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"count"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5UInt8V","text":"UInt8"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"content"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/init(selectedTab:count:content:)"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSBadgeCount":{"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsbadgecount","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeCount","abstract":[{"text":"Badge is a UI element that emphasizes system notifications, status, or the categorization of an information, throughout colour only.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Badge is rendered as a coloured shape, without icon, text or number; and its chosen size remains unchanged regardless of the changes of the interface size.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeCount","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" displays a text, as integer, limited to 99.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSBadgeCount","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"OUDSBadgeCount","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSBadgeCount","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"component_tabBar_Wireframe_dark":{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Wireframe_dark","alt":"A  tab bar component in dark mode without Liquid Glass effect and Wireframe theme","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_Wireframe_dark.png"}],"type":"image"},"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_dark":{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_dark","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_dark.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"A  tab bar component in dark mode with Liquid Glass effect and Sosh theme"},"component_tabBar_Sosh_dark":{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Sosh_dark","alt":"A  tab bar component in dark mode without Liquid Glass effect and Sosh theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_Sosh_dark.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image"},"https://r.orange.fr/r/S-ouds-doc-ios-tab-bar":{"titleInlineContent":[{"text":"unified-design-system.orange.com","type":"text"}],"url":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-ios-tab-bar","type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-ios-tab-bar","title":"unified-design-system.orange.com"},"component_tabBar_Orange_light":{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Orange_light","alt":"A tab bar component in light mode without Liquid Glass effect and Orange theme","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_Orange_light.png"}],"type":"image"},"doc://OUDSComponents/s8SendableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable"},"component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_light":{"type":"image","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_light.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"identifier":"component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_light","alt":"A  tab bar component in light mode without Liquid Glass effect and Orange Compact theme"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSTabBar/View-Implementations":{"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstabbar\/view-implementations","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/View-Implementations","abstract":[],"title":"View Implementations","role":"collectionGroup","type":"topic","kind":"article"},"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_dark":{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_dark","alt":"A  tab bar component in dark mode with Liquid Glass effect and Wireframe theme","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_dark.png"}],"type":"image"},"component_tabBar_Sosh_light":{"alt":"A  tab bar component in light mode without Liquid Glass effect and Sosh theme","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_Sosh_light.png"}],"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Sosh_light"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSTabView":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tab view component that accepts native SwiftUI "},{"code":"Tab","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" items (iOS 18+) while applying the full OUDS"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tab bar appearance — colors, ty